  "as_of": "2025-10-29",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would retrospectively validate specified handling of students' tax file numbers (TFNs) by approved vocational education loan providers and relevant government officers administering student loans.",
   "Authorisation would cover dealings from 1 January 2017 until immediately before 1 October 2025, limited to administering or facilitating student loan applications and loans.",
   "The measure would cover past conduct within that scope, excluding other purposes and misuse, while preserving proceedings or privacy complaints already finalised before commencement."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The student loans legislation would be treated as taxation law for specified TFN handling provisions.",
   "The validation would apply when deciding relevant proceedings and privacy complaints still pending or brought after commencement.",
   "Reasonable Commonwealth compensation would be available if the validation acquired property without just terms, including by extinguishing an accrued cause of action."
  ],
  "affected": "Vocational education loan students, approved providers and their officers, relevant Commonwealth officers and the Commissioner of Taxation are affected.",
